{
    "$schema": "https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json",
    "packageRules": [
      {
        "description": ["Block automerge for ingress-nginx minors"],
        "matchUpdateTypes": ["minor"],
        "automerge": false,
        "matchPackageNames": ["ingress-nginx"],
        "labels": ["type/minor"]
      },
      {
        "description": ["Block automerge for app template minors"],
        "matchUpdateTypes": ["minor"],
        "automerge": false,
        "matchPackageNames": ["app-template"],
        "labels": ["type/minor"]
      },
      {
        "description": [
          "Helm chart minor and major updates need an explicit dashboard click. Chart patches fall through to the truecharts patch preset (automerge).",
          "Chart value schemas change between versions, and the truecharts defaults automerge patch and minor, so a merged bump can leave a HelmRelease unable to render. That broke immich, joplin-server, navidrome, vaultwarden, xteve and audiobookshelf on 2026-11-11 (volsync schema changes) and nextcloud on 2026-11-12 (chart 49.2.6 added a persistence.logs PVC).",
          "Scoped by depType so image updates, including the digest pins Renovate maintains for images built in this cluster, still automerge."
        ],
        "matchDepTypes": ["HelmChart"],
        "matchUpdateTypes": ["minor", "major"],
        "automerge": false,
        "dependencyDashboardApproval": true
      }
    ],
    "customManagers": [
      {
        "customType": "regex",
        "description": [
          "Image deps in HelmReleases that use the docker.${DOMAIN_1} registry variable.",
          "The built-in flux manager skips these with skipReason=contains-variable, because it reads the literal file and refuses to resolve a depName containing a variable. Flux substitutes DOMAIN_1 at reconcile time, so the regex manager resolves the host from the cluster-config ConfigMap instead.",
          "First pattern: digest-pinned tags, e.g. tag: latest@sha256:abc...",
          "Second pattern: plain tags, e.g. tag: prod"
        ],
        "fileMatch": ["(^|/)clusters/.+\\.ya?ml$"],
        "matchStrings": [
          "repository: docker\\.\\$\\{DOMAIN_1\\}/(?<depName>[^\\s]+)\\n\\s+tag: (?<currentValue>[^@\\s]+)@(?<currentDigest>sha256:\\S+)",
          "repository: docker\\.\\$\\{DOMAIN_1\\}/(?<depName>[^\\s]+)\\n\\s+tag: (?<currentValue>[^@\\s]+)\\n"
        ],
        "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
        "registryUrlTemplate": "https://docker.mooneybin.net",
        "versioningTemplate": "docker"
      }
    ]
  }
